Infection Control: Strict sterilization and infection-prevention requirements are encouraging healthcare facilities to adopt pre-sterilized and single-use tray solutions.
Workflow Efficiency: Pre-assembled trays help hospitals and ambulatory surgical centers reduce preparation time, standardize procedures, and improve operating-room efficiency.

